{"title":"2015 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 4","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Note\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Note</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Note\">Note</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Note\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>This problem is also problem number 5 on the 2015 AMC 10B, just with different names.\n<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php/2015_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_5\">This is the link.</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Lian, Marzuq, Rafsan, Arabi, Nabeel, and Rahul were in a 12-person race with 6 other people. Nabeel finished 6 places ahead of Marzuq. Arabi finished 1 place behind Rafsan. Lian finished 2 places behind Marzuq. Rafsan finished 2 places behind Rahul. Rahul finished 1 place behind Nabeel. Arabi finished in 6th place. Who finished in 8th place?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/f/8/0f8a9e10c8fb3b0aa8d8f17671731dcf716c8377.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\; \\text{Lian} \\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\; \\text{Marzuq} \\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\; \\text{Rafsan} \\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\; \\text{Nabeel} \\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\; \\text{Rahul}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"531\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let --- denote any of the 6 racers not named. Then the correct order looks like this:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/c/3/ec364be22d6d93081d6a952a2a475fea025d3694.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[-, \\text{Nabeel}, \\text{Rahul}, -, \\text{Rafsan}, \\text{Arabi}, -, \\text{Marzuq}, -, \\text{Lian}, -, -\\]\" width=\"442\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p>Thus the 8th place runner is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/c/60c99565dcf1c01dab07fb7b2b578b937500b6a3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(B)}\\; \\text{Marzuq}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"102\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We list the people out vertically for clarity, starting with Marzuq and working from there.\n</p><p><br />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/5/105aa601b74d255fdec68cea63a561c4634d492d.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[1 -\\]\" width=\"20\" height=\"12\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/c/a/9ca6eb51f0291777cc58c5cdc75bf68be108dd8e.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[2 \\text{Nabeel}\\]\" width=\"58\" height=\"12\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/8/2/c82430f899e43f0cad590dcf4eafdf1108b223d1.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[3 \\text{Rahul}\\]\" width=\"51\" height=\"12\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/d/34dde0e8318825de00c6c696b1c5e715454d4420.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[4 -\\]\" width=\"21\" height=\"12\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/d/b/bdb4b9bf130d25b99559442531adf9a9abefb547.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[5 \\text{Rafsan}\\]\" width=\"58\" height=\"13\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/4/f/24f1a33d2d70f22868b48630b47539e4b1a81b2f.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[6 \\text{Arabi}\\]\" width=\"49\" height=\"12\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/4/f/14fa5dbaae18d5eaff20f23b696f5eac2a6254be.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[7 -\\]\" width=\"21\" height=\"12\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/5/0953657fbaedfaf8e896893c01bb26f7173899c9.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[8 \\text{Marzuq}\\]\" width=\"64\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p>Thus our answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/c/60c99565dcf1c01dab07fb7b2b578b937500b6a3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(B)}\\; \\text{Marzuq}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"102\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"2\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_12B\" title=\"2015 AMC 12B\">2015 AMC 12B</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_12B_Problems\" title=\"2015 AMC 12B Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_12B_Answer_Key\" title=\"2015 AMC 12B Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2015 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2015 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 5\">Problem 5</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2015 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2015 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2015 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2015 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 5\">5</a>